kitr (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix text drawn too thin: glyph masks were premultiplied twice.
  * Composite frames in linear light into an sRGB target, like kitty.
  * Draw emoji-presentation text from a colour font, like kitty.
  * Downscale colour glyphs with area averaging instead of point sampling.
  * Show command/host-based tab and window titles and keep them updated from
    OSC 0/2, with sanitised single-line fallbacks.
  * Make the tab bar clickable, add middle-click close and text-select cursors.
  * Restore drag selection, double/triple-click word and line selection,
    selection rendering and copy.
  * Keep the application alive when one tab exits; treat PTY EIO as EOF so
    exited tabs are reaped reliably.

 -- kitr contributors <maintainers@portlandhodl.example>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:30:00 +0000

kitr (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Send mouse reports with the CSI introducer.
  * Do not treat xterm modifyOtherKeys (CSI > ... m) as SGR.
  * Load kitty.conf from the kitty config directory by default.
  * Match font names as full and PostScript names, like kitty.

 -- kitr contributors <maintainers@portlandhodl.example>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:30:00 +0000

kitr (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix runtime dependencies for current distributions.
  * Bundle hicolor application icons.
  * Accept squashed font family names and honour symbol_map.

 -- kitr contributors <maintainers@portlandhodl.example>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:10:00 +0000

